@page "/privacy"
<PageTitle>Privacy &amp; Cookies · Ziplio</PageTitle>
<section class="zl-panel result" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <h1 id="privacy-title">Privacy &amp; Cookies</h1>
    <p>Updated October 14, 2026. Ziplio stores links you create and, for signed-in accounts, workspace membership and link activity. We use click aggregates to show link insights. Hashed visitor estimates are kept for 35 days. If you use the <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> form, we store your message and the details you provide so we can respond. When email notifications are enabled, the message is sent through Azure Communication Services to our mailbox.</p>
    <h2>Cookies we use</h2>
    <p>We use only cookies needed to run the service: an authentication cookie keeps you signed in; an antiforgery cookie protects forms; and a Container Apps affinity cookie keeps your live Web session connected to the same server. These cookies are needed for the requested service.</p>
    <h2>Tracking and contact</h2>
    <p>We do not use advertising cookies or third-party tracking scripts. Fonts and other page assets are served by Ziplio. For questions about your data, use the <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> form.</p>
</section>
